INTERPRETATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
  CMAverse and regmedint share the closed-form formulas and give the
  same conditional OR (1.523 and 1.523).
  The closed form relies on the rare-outcome approximation. At an
  outcome prevalence of 0.33 the exact conditional OR is 1.454.
  CMAverse g-computation and the hand-coded g-computation differ by
  0.6% on the marginal scale.
  The mediation package reports on the probability-difference scale, so
  its estimate is not comparable with the odds ratios without
  transformation.
